# TPS_SWCT_01169 - Support for partial networking
# 纯概念性定义，无可观测结构约束，不建 SHACL。

# TPS_SWCT_01170 - Purpose of Virtual Function Cluster
# 纯概念性定义，无可观测结构约束，不建 SHACL。

# TPS_SWCT_01171 - Purpose of a control port
# 语义：作为控制端口的 PortPrototype 必须被一个 isService=true 的 PortInterface 类型化。
# 由于“控制端口”本身无法从静态结构直接识别，结构层面仅能对 PortInterface 的 IS-SERVICE 建模，
# 且 IS-SERVICE 已在 meta-model 中为必选布尔值，此处不重复建约束。

# TPS_SWCT_01172 - Requesting and releasing partial networks
# 描述 BSW 接口的两种方式（ComM / BswM），不形成强制结构约束，不建 SHACL。

# TPS_SWCT_01173 - Control port shall not become a part of the PortGroup
# 需要识别“控制端口”以及 PortGroup 成员关系，属语义/角色级约束，交由 SMT 处理，此处不建 SHACL。


# SHACL shapes for selected structurally-checkable parts

# TPS_SWCT_01174 - Status port shall not become a member of the PortGroup
# Purely relational/behavioral, no stable XML paths for status port vs PortGroup membership.
# → Leave to SMT only (no SHACL shape).

# TPS_SWCT_01175 - Actively query the status of a partial network
# Purely behavioral, no structural XML constraint.
# → No SHACL.

# TPS_SWCT_01176 - last-is-best semantics for sender-receiver communication
# Behavioral semantics depending on swImplPolicy; no explicit swImplPolicy path given.
# → No SHACL.

# TPS_SWCT_01180 - Maximum possible size of Compound Primitive Data Type
# Depends on AttributeValueVariationPoint and SwSystemconst; no explicit paths.
# → No SHACL.

# TPS_SWCT_01181 - Bound model specifies a primitive smaller than maximum
# Purely tool behavior; no structural XML constraint.
# → No SHACL.

# TPS_SWCT_01182 - Conceptual levels for the definition of initial values
# Structural part: existence of INIT-VALUE on NONQUEUED-SENDER-COM-SPEC (minOccurs=1)

autosar:TPS_SWCT_01182_NonqueuedSenderComSpec_InitValueShape
    a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass autosar:NONQUEUED-SENDER-COM-SPEC ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path autosar:INIT-VALUE ;
        sh:minCount 1 ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:severity sh:Violation ;
        sh:message "NONQUEUED-SENDER-COM-SPEC shall have exactly one INIT-VALUE (TPS_SWCT_01182, level 2 initValue definition)." ;
    ] .

# Other INIT-VALUE / APPL-INIT-VALUE / IMPL-INIT-VALUE occurrences are optional
# and only participate in precedence semantics, which is handled in SMT.

# TPS_SWCT_01183 - Actual value of an initValue shall be interpreted according to the AutosarDataType
# Interpretation semantics only; no additional structural constraint beyond existing schema.
# → No SHACL.


# 1) TPS_SWCT_01184 - ApplicationPrimitiveDataTypes with category VALUE
# 语义涉及“initValues 以 physical values 提供且 RTE 能正确评估 CompuMethod”，
# 属运行时/工具行为，缺乏可观测静态结构，不生成 SHACL 结构约束。

# 2) TPS_SWCT_01191 - mapped ApplicationDataType and ImplementationDataType shall be compatible
# 兼容性为语义/实现层面，不可从静态 XML 结构直接判断，不生成 SHACL。

# 3) TPS_SWCT_01192 - Meta-classes that have an association to a DataTypeMappingSet
# 仅说明哪些 meta-class 拥有到 DATA-TYPE-MAPPING-SET 的关联，非强制存在性或计数要求，不生成 SHACL。

# 4) TPS_SWCT_01193 - Mappings do not necessarily have to form a 1:1 relation
# 明确允许 1:n / n:1，属于“非约束”，不生成 SHACL。

# 5) TPS_SWCT_01194 - Symbolic name of an ImplementationDataType
# 语义：SYMBOL-PROPS 可选；若存在，则必须包含必选的 SYMBOL。
# target 为 IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE（由 expression/title 判定），
# SYMBOL-PROPS/SYMBOL 路径来自 path_variants。

autosar:TPS_SWCT_01194_Shape
    a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass autosar:IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE ;
    sh:severity sh:Info ;

    # 如果存在 SYMBOL-PROPS，则其下必须有 SYMBOL
    sh:property [
