    sh:targetClass autosar:SW-BASE-TYPE ;
    sh:severity sh:Info ;
    sh:message "Further use cases for SwBaseType (documentation, debugging, measurement/calibration support)." .

# 6) TPS_SWCT_01264 – Data prototypes implement a role of a data type
# 定义性语句，不强制具体结构（如 is-of-type 关系在其他规则中建模）

